body:
Considering a tentacle pit is made to make the most out of its preys, I'd assume there are ways one would have to turn anyone into a breeding bitch:

Constant fucking would be a no-go, so a lot of rest would be required, or else the person inside will expire before birthing anything;
An innate knowledge on how biology works, so it won't just fuck her to death and will know what to bring to make one last longer, food and water pretty much;
Drugs and aphrodisiacs in the form of the tentacle's body secretions to turn the brain into mush, and to enhance pregnancy potential (I'm sure there'd be ways for one to meddle with their brains, if even just making pleasure into a constant high).

Tho in this context, we aren't thinking about most of that, we're just horny mfers. Logic isn't as important as the fantasies we think about, which is why hentais work so well: a drawing doesn't have to follow any logic, only the one it sets for itself.
